--- task
id: t04
dataset: section8
kind: membership in a list literal

--- intent
List the names of people who live in Berlin or Paris.

--- edition2
query in_cities() {
  match { $p: Person  $p.city in ["Berlin", "Paris"] }
  return { $p.name }
}

--- edition3
query in_cities() {
  match { $p: Person  $p.city in ["Berlin", "Paris"] }
  return { $p.name }
}

--- expect unordered
columns: ["p.name"]
["Alice"]
["Bob"]
["Dave"]
["Frank"]
